{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_92_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_92","textTraditional":"一、二十有九年，春，介葛盧來。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_92_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_92","textTraditional":"介葛盧者何？夷狄之君也。何以不言朝？不能乎朝也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_92_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_92","textTraditional":"二、公至自圍許。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_92_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_92","textTraditional":"三、夏六月，公會王人、晉人、宋人、齊人、陳人、蔡人、秦人，盟于狄泉。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_92_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_92","textTraditional":"四、秋，大雨雹。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_92_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_92","textTraditional":"五、冬，介葛盧來。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}